ess-0.0.1.gem","downloads":3996,"mailing_list_uri":null,"name":"socket-harness","wiki_uri":null,"version_downloads":3996,"info":"SocketHarness is a test utilities that helps implement Test Harness pattern from the book "Release it!". It seats between application and integration server to simulate odd network/application behaviors, e.g. slow network.","authors":"wpc"},{"documentation_uri":null,"metadata":{"homepage_uri":"https://github.com/jovan-sremacki/echo-api","source_code_uri":"https://github.com/jovan-sremacki/echo-api"},"homepage_uri":"https://github.com/jovan-sremacki/echo-api","funding_uri":null,"bug_tracker_uri":null,"project_uri":"https://rubygems.org/gems/echo_api","version":"0.1.0","sha":"73a421a83929176d2dc502635d58663dab3da3f52e8e1cf1d9f698c5b7d47a4a","platform":"ruby","changelog_uri":null,"source_code_uri":"https://github.com/jovan-sremacki/echo-api","licenses":["MIT"],"gem_uri":"https://rubygems.org/gems/echo_api-0.1.0.gem","downloads":649,"mailing_list_uri":null,"name":"echo_api","wiki_uri":null,"version_downloads":649,"info":"EchoAPI is a Ruby gem designed to simplify the process of mocking and simulating external API calls. 
